                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9efef8fa-3d7f-3c92-9903-d952f1d69d4c",
                        "entry_id": "40b605af-fd3b-387e-9206-cfbdbefaefff",
                        "glosses": [
                            "deutsche Bezeichnung für Interjektion"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d591560-9ee7-410b-a157-cd710b7dcd6e",
                                "sense_id": "9efef8fa-3d7f-3c92-9903-d952f1d69d4c",
                                "text": "„ah“, „aua“ und „oh“ sind Empfindungswörter."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d3fa139-b749-4537-9a42-719d36d13de4",
                                "sense_id": "9efef8fa-3d7f-3c92-9903-d952f1d69d4c",
                                "text": "„Charakteristisch für die Sprache in den Comics sind die Empfindungswörter, die Interjektionen, darunter besonders die Lautnachahmungen, die Onomatopoetika beziehungsweise Onomatopoiien.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2adf4ab6-a768-45cc-a469-5ef170eee508",
                        "source_entry_id": "40b605af-fd3b-387e-9206-cfbdbefaefff",
                        "source_sense_id": "9efef8fa-3d7f-3c92-9903-d952f1d69d4c",
                        "source_sense_description": "Linguistik: deutsche Bezeichnung für Interjektion",
                        "target_lang_word": "interjection",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "interjection",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea6fde5c-9270-395f-a046-17f608014cf4",
                                        "entry_id": "f7d742bf-4201-3ff0-98d0-5f86ad9b5f5e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An exclamation or filled pause; a word or phrase with no particular grammatical relation to a sentence, often an expression of emotion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e19b7e77-33bc-49f8-8fc8-85c1dc2187da",
                                                "sense_id": "ea6fde5c-9270-395f-a046-17f608014cf4",
                                                "text": "322. The parts of speech which are neither declined nor conjugated, are called by the general name of particles. 323. They are adverbs, prepositions, conjunctions, and interjections."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba4a458e-09fb-4094-8d3b-18c6e15a2e34",
                                                "sense_id": "ea6fde5c-9270-395f-a046-17f608014cf4",
                                                "text": "Some evidence confirming our suspicions that topicalised and dislocated constituents occupy different sentence positions comes from Greenberg (1984). He notes that in colloquial speech the interjection man can occur after dislocated constituents, but not after topicalised constituents: cf.\n (21) (a) Bill, man, I really hate him (dislocated NP)\n (21) (b) ^✽Bill, man, I really hate (topicalised NP)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28948234-fc21-32b1-a74a-107373a83adc",
                                        "entry_id": "f7d742bf-4201-3ff0-98d0-5f86ad9b5f5e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An interruption; something interjected"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "079227b5-37e6-4c59-b6d4-c48f25360b4b",
                                                "sense_id": "28948234-fc21-32b1-a74a-107373a83adc",
                                                "text": "Mnuchin, asked about climate change in a CNBC interview after his comments about Thunberg, argued there were bigger issues that also needed to be addressed. When a host noted clean air rules as an example of something that might be more urgent, Mnuchin ignored the interjection."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0935ae39-2aa9-42b8-8e2a-3a950a0558d1",
                        "source_entry_id": "40b605af-fd3b-387e-9206-cfbdbefaefff",
                        "source_sense_id": "9efef8fa-3d7f-3c92-9903-d952f1d69d4c",
                        "source_sense_description": "Linguistik: deutsche Bezeichnung für Interjektion",
                        "target_lang_word": "interjection",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "interjection",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6be0aeb-3dff-35b7-b9c2-0b3e704a48e4",
                                        "entry_id": "890e1de3-ad81-3816-86aa-71b181af5142",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Catégorie de mot invariable, permettant au sujet parlant, l'énonciateur, d'exprimer une émotion spontanée, d'adresser un message au destinataire, ou encore de réaliser approximativement une image sonore d'un événement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61b7981d-1fc2-487e-ae3c-ddb26793d74f",
                                                "sense_id": "a6be0aeb-3dff-35b7-b9c2-0b3e704a48e4",
                                                "text": "Thomas Black s’échappait en interjections admiratives. Il applaudissait ce firmament tout constellé."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b7d40f9-11c6-4290-8e12-ac77d52218a1",
                                                "sense_id": "a6be0aeb-3dff-35b7-b9c2-0b3e704a48e4",
                                                "text": "À la tombée du jour, égaré dans une jungle de paroles, tressaillant au moindre bruit, prenant les craquements du parquet pour des interjections, je croyais découvrir le langage à l’état de nature, sans les hommes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06a4ee2b-3a11-4b1c-b483-0ab8c8c0c551",
                                                "sense_id": "a6be0aeb-3dff-35b7-b9c2-0b3e704a48e4",
                                                "text": "La conversation s’engage, ponctuée d’interjections courantes : macaniche ! boudu ! ou boudious !, interrompue parfois d’un chézus ! de pitié ou d’un baytembay (va t’en va !) ironique quand elle ne se termine pas par un énergique byétazé ! dont les convenances ne nous permettent pas de donner l’étymologie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7e55f883-05a7-4b6d-87c8-2824cb75f6bb",
                        "source_entry_id": "40b605af-fd3b-387e-9206-cfbdbefaefff",
                        "source_sense_id": "9efef8fa-3d7f-3c92-9903-d952f1d69d4c",
                        "source_sense_description": "Linguistik: deutsche Bezeichnung für Interjektion",
                        "target_lang_word": "interjección",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "interjección",
